\'93Okay, camera team six. You\'92re with me,\'94 Alexander called, waving a random crew his way. He headed for the gates. \'93Supporting cast! Let\'92s make broadcasting history!\'94\
\'93You\'92re not going in,\'94 Kathy warned Alexander as the guard formed a blockade before the gates.\
