Kathy stopped and fixed Hayley with a gaze. \'93You either.\'94\
\'93What?\'94 Hayley squawked. \'93I\'92m on their side.\'94\
\'93Sorry,\'94 Kathy said, much gentler than the circumstance may have required. \'93In another time, another place\'85\'94 She made a regretful grimace.\
